== Part 3. Libraries compiled into ChatonLM ==

The npm packages and Rust crates compiled into ChatonLM, with their licenses,
are listed in the licenses/ directory shipped with the .deb and the AppImage
(/usr/share/doc/chatonlm/licenses): npm-packages.txt, written from the list of
packages of the user interface bundle, and rust-crates.txt, written by
cargo-about. Components licensed under MPL-2.0 are used unmodified; the
generated list gives, for each of them, the address of its source code.

Some notices that apply to the npm packages below are missing from the
packages, in whole or in part, so they are given here. Some Rust crates also
compile C and C++ libraries into ChatonLM, or are ports of such code to Rust:
their notices follow those of the npm packages.

